  "mechanisms": [
    "Disabled by default, no process launcher or model-management call. Architecture checks prohibit production assistance os/exec. No local model was started, loaded, warmed or evaluated during these checks.",
    "Separate local profile management with explicit ai_manage; immutable administrator-selected version/hash, manifest digest check, declared tokenizer identity and explicit remote policy. Profile configuration is not profile qualification.",
    "Prepare only actor-authorized connection/run metadata, bounded redacted text and aliases. IDs, paths, filenames and secret references remain outside prompts. Freeform text is disabled by default; heuristic redaction does not replace exact disclosure review.",
    "Exact context hash/revision approval requires ai_disclose. Current actor/mount/profile/resource snapshots are checked before disclosure, during the request and before accepting output; changed state supersedes output.",
    "Three new actor-private forced-RLS tables, exact event/projection guards and idempotency receipts. Live runtime checks cover all 23 domain relations. Existing credentials gain no implicit AI grants.",
    "One independent PostgreSQL admission slot across processes, no waiting inference queue, durable attempt before HTTP, 70-second lease, two-attempt budget and stable-key replay without another disclosure.",
    "Configured endpoint only: normal TLS, numeric loopback HTTP, explicit remote HTTPS, no redirects/proxy, bounded bytes/time/token requests and endpoint-reported usage. An endpoint can load a model itself; actual resource qualification remains open.",
    "Strict output decisions accept only selected destination aliases or supported evidence findings. Forged recipient, approval, completion and citation are rejected outside the model. No shell, arbitrary tool or recovery execution exists.",
    "Adoption creates only an ordinary unapproved workflow draft through shared validation; draft, provenance and receipt commit together. A failed receipt rolls back adoption. No run or delivery is created by adoption.",
    "After explicit ordinary workflow approval, a stock independent SFTP client verifies exact synthetic 2 MiB bytes at a separate stock receiver while assistance is disabled. This is a deterministic control/transport contract, not real-model outage qualification.",
    "Six real-PostgreSQL assistance regressions, strict API malformed-input regression, validation/backend contracts and bounded output fuzzing run without inference. Native suite source hashes are unchanged throughout all sixteen checks."
  ],
